        "tag": "main",
        "text": "4 speed 9 parking d check i warrant"
      },
      {
        "y": 351.3,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 450.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "5 search 10 restricted e camera j card"
      },
      {
        "y": 367.7,
        "x0": 78.5,
        "x1": 102,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "35.3"
      },
      {
        "y": 370.2,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 188.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "What do we call:"
      },
      {
        "y": 386.7,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 310.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 a police officer who does not wear uniform?"
      },
      {
        "y": 398.7,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 393.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "2 a person whose job it is to check that no one is parked illegally?"
      },
      {
        "y": 410.7,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 409.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "3 police officers engaged in combating dishonest use of public funds?"
      },
      {
        "y": 422.7,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 495.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "4 the official paper you sometimes find stuck on your windscreen when you park illegally?"
      },
      {
        "y": 434.7,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 474,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "5 the type of police officer who might try to infiltrate a group suspected of terrorism?"
      },
      {
        "y": 446.7,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 332.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "6 the police and army considered as a single body?"
      },
      {
        "y": 463,
        "x0": 78.5,
        "x1": 102,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "35.4"
      },
      {
        "y": 465.5,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 478.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Choose a word from the box to complete each sentence. Put it in the correct form."
      },
      {
        "y": 486.3,
        "x0": 122.1,
        "x1": 505,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "detect suspicion exceed search enforce refugee persecution allowance"
      },
      {
        "y": 508.4,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 520.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 An official stopped the man because a sniffer dog had something in his suitcase."
      },
      {
        "y": 520.4,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 496.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "2 During the Civil War many crossed the border into neighbouring countries."
      },
      {
        "y": 532.4,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 514.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "3 Throughout the centuries many people have suffered for their religious beliefs."
      },
      {
        "y": 544.4,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 325.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "4 Ella was fined for the speed limit."
      },
      {
        "y": 556.4,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 432.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "5 It is a police officer’s duty to do all he or she can to the law."
      },
      {
        "y": 568.4,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 497.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "6 When you come into this country, the tobacco is 200 cigarettes per person."
      },
      {
        "y": 580.4,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 487.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "7 There are restrictions on the powers the police have to stop and people."
      },
      {
        "y": 592.4,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 501.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "8 The police have had about the activities at that address for some time now."
      },
      {
